<div class="elvora-policy-page-wrapper">
  <!-- Subtle Header Banner -->
  <div class="elvora-policy-header">
    <div class="elvora-policy-badge">
      <span class="elvora-policy-dot"></span>
      <span>Official Store Policy • CS619 Compliant</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="elvora-policy-title">Return & Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="elvora-policy-subtitle">
      7-Day Risk-Free Clinical Guarantee, simple replacements, and rapid refunds via Bank Transfer, JazzCash, or Easypaisa across Pakistan.
    </p>
    <div class="elvora-policy-meta">
      <span>Last Updated: November 2026</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>7-Day Return Window</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>Free Transit Replacement</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Quick Nav Tabs -->
  <div class="elvora-policy-tabs-nav">
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=shipping-policy" class="elvora-policy-tab">Shipping Policy</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=privacy-policy" class="elvora-policy-tab">Privacy Policy</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=return-and-refund-policy" class="elvora-policy-tab is-active">Return & Refund Policy</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=terms-and-conditions" class="elvora-policy-tab">Terms & Conditions</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact?view=faq" class="elvora-policy-tab">FAQ</a>
    <a href="/pages/contact" class="elvora-policy-tab">Contact Us</a>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Content Card -->
  <div class="elvora-policy-content-card">
    
    <!-- Highlights Grid -->
    <div class="elvora-policy-highlights-grid">
      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>7-Day Hassle-Free Returns</h4>
          <p>Report damaged, incorrect, or defective products within 7 calendar days of receipt.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Instant Free Replacement</h4>
          <p>Broken glass, leaking pumps, or wrong variant? We dispatch an immediate replacement at zero cost.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Flexible Payout Channels</h4>
          <p>Direct refund to Bank Account, JazzCash, Easypaisa, or 110% store credit voucher.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="elvora-highlight-item">
        <div class="elvora-highlight-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M9.172 9.172L5.636 5.636m3.536 9.192l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-5 0a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Clinical Support Advice</h4>
          <p>Our skin consultants evaluate adverse reactions to provide alternative corrective formulations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Article Sections -->
    <div class="elvora-policy-body">
      <h2>1. The ELVORA Clinical Satisfaction Guarantee</h2>
      <p>
        At ELVORA Skincare, every formulation is developed under strict dermatological testing protocols. We stand behind our clinical products with a comprehensive <strong>7-Day Risk-Free Return & Exchange Policy</strong>. If your delivery does not meet our high standards, we are committed to making it right immediately.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Eligibility for Returns & Exchanges</h2>
      <p>A return or replacement request qualifies under the following terms:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Transit Damage or Defective Packaging:</strong> Dropper bottle cracked, safety seal broken upon arrival, or product leaking.</li>
        <li><strong>Incorrect Formulation Delivered:</strong> Order arrived with a serum, cleanser, or cream different from your purchase confirmation.</li>
        <li><strong>Unopened / Sealed Units:</strong> Unused products in original box packaging with plastic seal intact within 7 calendar days of delivery.</li>
        <li><strong>Adverse Reaction:</strong> In the rare instance of an allergic reaction or severe irritation, submit photos within 7 days. Our dermatological support desk will process a full store exchange or refund.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Step-by-Step Return Procedure</h2>
      <div class="elvora-policy-steps-grid">
        <div class="elvora-step-card">
          <div class="elvora-step-num">1</div>
          <h5>Submit Request</h5>
          <p>WhatsApp <strong>+92 300 1234567</strong> or email <strong>support@elvora.pk</strong> with your Order Number and photos of the item.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="elvora-step-card">
          <div class="elvora-step-num">2</div>
          <h5>Quick Authorization</h5>
          <p>Our team verifies your claim within 4 to 6 business hours and issues an authorized Return Tracking ID.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="elvora-step-card">
          <div class="elvora-step-num">3</div>
          <h5>Courier Reverse Pickup</h5>
          <p>Our courier partner (TCS or Trax) picks up the parcel from your doorstep at our expense.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="elvora-step-card">
          <div class="elvora-step-num">4</div>
          <h5>Refund Disbursed</h5>
          <p>Funds are credited via Bank Transfer, JazzCash, or Easypaisa within 3–5 working days.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>4. Refund Modes & Timelines</h2>
      <div class="elvora-policy-table-wrap">
        <table class="elvora-policy-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Original Payment</th>
              <th>Refund Mechanism</th>
              <th>Turnaround Time</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD)</strong></td>
              <td>Direct Bank Transfer (IBAN) / JazzCash / Easypaisa</td>
              <td>3 - 5 Business Days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Online Card / Prepaid</strong></td>
              <td>Reversal to original Visa / Mastercard</td>
              <td>5 - 7 Bank Working Days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Store Credit (VIP)</strong></td>
              <td>ELVORA Gift Voucher + <strong>10% Bonus Credit</strong></td>
              <td>Instant (Within 1 Hour)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2>5. Non-Returnable Products</h2>
      <p>For sanitary and cosmetic integrity reasons, the following items are strictly non-returnable:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Products with damaged or removed authenticity QR codes / batch numbers.</li>
        <li>Items returned after more than 7 days from the recorded courier delivery timestamp.</li>
        <li>Free promotional sample miniatures or VIP gift cards.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="elvora-policy-contact-box">
        <h4>Need to Initiate a Return or Exchange?</h4>
        <p>Our customer care team handles all requests with zero friction and fast resolution.</p>
        <div class="elvora-policy-contact-actions">
          <a href="https://wa.me/923001234567?text=Hello%20ELVORA,%20I%20would%20like%20to%20request%20a%20return%20or%20exchange" target="_blank" class="elvora-policy-btn-whatsapp">
            <span>WhatsApp Care: +92 300 1234567</span>
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:support@elvora.pk" class="elvora-policy-btn-email">
            <span>Email: support@elvora.pk</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  if ((window.location.search.includes('view=return-and-refund-policy') || window.location.search.includes('view=refund-policy')) && !window.location.pathname.includes('return-and-refund-policy')) {
    try { window.history.replaceState({}, '', '/pages/return-and-refund-policy'); } catch(e){}
  }
</script>

